{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01V1jUu9oV7HQq6hue4xmXQp","type":"tool_result","content":"You are going to encounter other study material. Videos, blog posts, practice question sets, competing books, a colleague's notes from when they passed. Some of it is excellent. Here is how to check whether it describes your exam, in about fifteen seconds:\n\n**Count the domains.** If the material is organized around **five** domains, or carries a standalone chapter or section titled \"Cloud Native Observability\" presented as a domain in its own right, it was built for the retired blueprint. That doesn't make its facts wrong; a Pod worked the same way in 2024. But its *weighting* is wrong, which makes its emphasis wrong, which makes its practice sets wrong, which makes the picture it hands you of where the exam's mass sits wrong. Specifically, it will under-serve Application Delivery by roughly half.\n\nUse it for facts if you like. Don't use it to allocate your time.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3f9b02ac-049e-468e-9571-70af8edf8dd5","uuid":"30eb3c48-9992-4a50-bf3e-cbc2013e2f47","timestamp":"2026-08-24T19:46:54.886Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"You are going to encounter other study material. Videos, blog posts, practice question sets, competing books, a colleague's notes from when they passed. Some of it is excellent. Here is how to check whether it describes your exam, in about fifteen seconds:\n\n**Count the domains.** If the material is organized around **five** domains, or carries a standalone chapter or section titled \"Cloud Native Observability\" presented as a domain in its own right, it was built for the retired blueprint. That doesn't make its facts wrong; a Pod worked the same way in 2024. But its *weighting* is wrong, which makes its emphasis wrong, which makes its practice sets wrong, which makes the picture it hands you of where the exam's mass sits wrong. Specifically, it will under-serve Application Delivery by roughly half.\n\nUse it for facts if you like. Don't use it to allocate your time.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
