{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wz2qRDd57ZvtUrExzjB4eR","type":"tool_result","content":"32:*If you only have 15 minutes:* read §1, then read §4's three-effect table, then work ☆ Taking Your Bearings #2. That is, in my judgement, the densest fifteen minutes in the \n116:*You'll also stop reading `Pending` as an error message, which is a smaller change than it sounds, and I think it saves more marks than anything else here.*\n226:This is the fact that converts *\"the cluster has loads of free memory but my Pod won't schedule\"* from a mystery into arithmetic. A node can be busy and empty at the same time,\n686:> 🔭 **Closer Look:** The documentation states the cost of these rules without explaining it: *\"Inter-pod affinity and anti-affinity require substantial amounts of processing\n707:> 🪝 **Snag:** \"Spread my replicas evenly across nodes\" and \"never put two of these together\" are different requirements. Anti-affinity states the second and only approximate","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3f9b02ac-049e-468e-9571-70af8edf8dd5","uuid":"c74b4a53-df62-467e-95fc-7bae8a6ead3a","timestamp":"2026-08-24T19:46:56.300Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"32:*If you only have 15 minutes:* read §1, then read §4's three-effect table, then work ☆ Taking Your Bearings #2. That is, in my judgement, the densest fifteen minutes in the \n116:*You'll also stop reading `Pending` as an error message, which is a smaller change than it sounds, and I think it saves more marks than anything else here.*\n226:This is the fact that converts *\"the cluster has loads of free memory but my Pod won't schedule\"* from a mystery into arithmetic. A node can be busy and empty at the same time,\n686:> 🔭 **Closer Look:** The documentation states the cost of these rules without explaining it: *\"Inter-pod affinity and anti-affinity require substantial amounts of processing\n707:> 🪝 **Snag:** \"Spread my replicas evenly across nodes\" and \"never put two of these together\" are different requirements. Anti-affinity states the second and only approximate","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
